{
	"title": "Calculer un taux de variation",
	"description": "Taux de variation (f(b) − f(a))/(b − a) d'un polynôme du second degré, de la fonction inverse, de la racine carrée entre deux carrés",
	"grades": ["1_SPE"],
	"theme": "Fonctions",
	"domain": "Dérivation",
	"subdomain": "Taux de variation",
	"level": 2,
	"delay": 60,
	"status": "draft",
	"shared": {
		"cleanCoefficients": true
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\mathbb{R}$ par $f(x)={{eval:m*x^2+n*x+c}}$.\n\nCalcule le taux de variation de $f$ entre ${{a}}$ et ${{b}}$.\n\n$\\dfrac{f({{b}})-f({{a}})}{{{b}}{{eval:-a;+}}}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "x|x"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "1..3;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "1..5;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "1..6;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "-3..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "eval:a+d"
				},
				{
					"name": "fa",
					"expression": "eval:m*a^2+n*a+c"
				},
				{
					"name": "fb",
					"expression": "eval:m*b^2+n*b+c"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["a != 0", "fa != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:m*(a+b)+n}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On calcule les deux images : $f({{a}})={{fa}}$ et $f({{b}})={{fb}}$.",
					"$$\\dfrac{f({{b}})-f({{a}})}{{{b}}{{eval:-a;+}}}=\\dfrac{{{fb}}{{eval:-fa;+}}}{{{d}}}=\\dfrac{{{eval:fb-fa}}}{{{d}}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:m*(a+b)+n}}}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Soit $f$ la fonction inverse, définie sur $]0\\,;+\\infty[$ par $f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{x}$.\n\nCalcule le taux de variation de $f$ entre ${{a}}$ et ${{b}}$.\n\n$\\dfrac{f({{b}})-f({{a}})}{{{b}}-{{a}}}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "3..7"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["a < b"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "-\\dfrac{1}{{{eval:a*b}}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$f({{b}})-f({{a}})=\\dfrac{1}{ {{b}} }-\\dfrac{1}{ {{a}} }=\\dfrac{{{a}}-{{b}}}{{{eval:a*b}}}=\\dfrac{{{eval:a-b}}}{{{eval:a*b}}}$.",
					"On divise par ${{b}}-{{a}}={{eval:b-a}}$ : $$\\dfrac{f({{b}})-f({{a}})}{{{b}}-{{a}}}=\\dfrac{{{eval:a-b}}}{{{eval:a*b}}\\times{{eval:b-a}}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{-\\dfrac{1}{{{eval:a*b}}}}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Soit $f$ la fonction racine carrée, définie sur $[0\\,;+\\infty[$ par $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}$.\n\nCalcule le taux de variation de $f$ entre ${{a}}$ et ${{b}}$.\n\n$\\dfrac{f({{b}})-f({{a}})}{{{b}}-{{a}}}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "eval:r+d"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "eval:r^2"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "eval:s^2"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\dfrac{1}{{{eval:r+s}}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$f({{a}})=\\sqrt{ {{a}} }={{r}}$ et $f({{b}})=\\sqrt{ {{b}} }={{s}}$.",
					"$$\\dfrac{f({{b}})-f({{a}})}{{{b}}-{{a}}}=\\dfrac{{{s}}-{{r}}}{{{eval:b-a}}}{{if:d==1||=\\dfrac{ {{d}} }{{{eval:b-a}}}}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\dfrac{1}{{{eval:r+s}}}}$$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "f(x) = x² + 2x + 3, entre 1 et 3 : 6",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"m": "1",
				"n": "2",
				"c": "3",
				"a": "1",
				"d": "2",
				"b": "3",
				"fa": "6",
				"fb": "18"
			},
			"answers": ["6"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : f(b) − f(a) sans diviser : 12",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"m": "1",
				"n": "2",
				"c": "3",
				"a": "1",
				"d": "2",
				"b": "3",
				"fa": "6",
				"fb": "18"
			},
			"answers": ["12"],
